00:00:31.345 --> 00:00:35.482
&gt;&gt; AT ONE TIME AND AS A

00:00:34.481 --> 00:00:36.617
CONTRACTOR AND CIA EMPLOYEE

00:00:35.616 --> 00:00:40.120
EDWARD SNOWDEN IS BELIEVED TO BE

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:40.955
IN HONG KONG TONIGHT HIDING OUT

00:00:40.254 --> 00:00:42.957
AFTER LEAKING INFORMATION.

00:00:41.088 --> 00:00:45.259
&gt;&gt; IT SHOOK THE WORLD DURING THE

00:00:43.090 --> 00:00:46.794
SUMMER OF 2013 AND EVER SINCE,

00:00:45.392 --> 00:00:47.561
THE NATIONAL SECURITY AGENCY AND

00:00:46.927 --> 00:00:52.566
CONGRESS HAVE BEEN EMBROILED IN

00:00:49.063 --> 00:00:53.367
AN EPIC BATTLE OF MASS

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:54.235
SURVEILLANCE.

00:00:53.501 --> 00:00:55.669
HE PUBLICLY CONFESSED TO

00:00:54.368 --> 00:00:56.403
STEALING A TROVE OF HIGHLY

00:00:55.803 --> 00:01:00.374
CLASSIFIED INTELLIGENCE ABOUT

00:00:56.537 --> 00:01:02.109
U.S. SURVEILLANCE PROGRAMS.

00:01:00.508 --> 00:01:03.744
SNOWDEN HANDED THAT INFORMATION

00:01:02.243 --> 00:01:05.779
OVER WHOLESALE AND IN THE

00:01:03.878 --> 00:01:06.814
PROCESS, REVEALED THAT THE INTEL

00:01:05.913 --> 00:01:07.882
COMMUNITY WAS COLLECTING

00:01:06.947 --> 00:01:09.950
INFORMATION ABOUT AMERICANS

00:01:08.015 --> 00:01:11.552
SUSPECTED OF HAVING TIES TO

00:01:10.084 --> 00:01:13.654
TERRORISM.

00:01:11.685 --> 00:01:15.089
THAT PROMPTED A NATIONAL OUTCRY.

00:01:13.787 --> 00:01:17.525
&gt;&gt; WHAT SNOWDEN DID MORE THAN

00:01:15.222 --> 00:01:20.327
ANYTHING ELSE AS HE BROUGHT ONE

00:01:17.658 --> 00:01:21.662
WORD TO THE FOREFRONT, PRIVACY.

00:01:20.461 --> 00:01:23.264
HE BURST PEOPLE'S BUBBLES.

00:01:21.795 --> 00:01:25.366
&gt;&gt; A LOT HAS HAPPENED IN THE

00:01:23.397 --> 00:01:25.699
ENSUING YEARS SINCE VERY PUBLIC

00:01:25.499 --> 00:01:27.168
FALLOUT.

00:01:25.833 --> 00:01:28.169
MEMBERS OF CONGRESS INSIST THEY

00:01:27.301 --> 00:01:31.172
ABUSE THEIR OVERSIGHT AUTHORITY

00:01:28.302 --> 00:01:32.973
TO TAMP DOWN ON NSA OPERATIONS.

00:01:31.305 --> 00:01:35.943
&gt;&gt; THERE HAVE BEEN A NUMBER OF

00:01:33.107 --> 00:01:37.945
REFORMS, MOST OF WHICH I CAN'T

00:01:36.076 --> 00:01:39.947
GO INTO BUT WE WANT TO MAKE SURE

00:01:38.078 --> 00:01:40.948
THAT WHAT HAPPENED WITH SNOWDEN

00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:43.184
DOESN'T HAPPEN AGAIN.

00:01:41.081 --> 00:01:45.386
&gt;&gt; I WOULD FOLLOW THE LAW, AND I

00:01:43.317 --> 00:01:47.655
WOULD INSURE IF CONFIRMED THAT

00:01:45.519 --> 00:01:49.157
THE AGENCY FOLLOWS THE LAW.

00:01:47.789 --> 00:01:50.358
&gt;&gt; CONGRESS AND THE DEFENSE

00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:52.160
DEPARTMENT ALSO ESTABLISHED THE

00:01:50.491 --> 00:01:53.628
U.S. CYBER COMMAND TO PROVIDE

00:01:52.293 --> 00:01:55.663
MILITARY SUPPORT FOR U.S.

00:01:53.761 --> 00:01:57.565
NETWORKS AND WHILE INTEL EXPERTS

00:01:55.797 --> 00:02:00.368
WIDELY VIEW THESE STEPS AS

00:01:57.698 --> 00:02:01.569
EFFECTIVE, THEY ALSO ACKNOWLEDGE

00:02:00.501 --> 00:02:04.372
THE NSA CONTINUES DATA

00:02:01.702 --> 00:02:05.373
COLLECTION OF AMERICANS.

00:02:04.505 --> 00:02:05.973
ABOUT 530 MILLION CALLS IN JUST

00:02:05.506 --> 00:02:07.408
A FEW EUROS.

00:02:06.107 --> 00:02:08.676
&gt;&gt; THE PROBLEM IS WE ARE

00:02:07.542 --> 00:02:10.611
COLLECTING MORE AND MORE BUT THE

00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:12.013
REAL QUESTION IS, HOW MUCH OF

00:02:10.745 --> 00:02:14.749
THIS ARE WE REALLY PROCESSING?

00:02:12.146 --> 00:02:15.016
HOW MUCH CAN WE MAKE DECISIONS

00:02:14.882 --> 00:02:16.617
ON?

00:02:15.149 --> 00:02:18.252
&gt;&gt; EUROPEAN COUNTRIES WERE ALSO

00:02:16.751 --> 00:02:18.653
HIT HARD BY THE SNOWDEN

00:02:18.386 --> 00:02:19.620
REVELATION.

00:02:18.786 --> 00:02:21.055
BRITAIN'S GOVERNMENT IN

00:02:19.754 --> 00:02:23.424
PARTICULAR IS STILL GRAPPLING TO

00:02:21.189 --> 00:02:25.493
THE STATE WITH MAJOR FALLOUT AS

00:02:23.558 --> 00:02:26.994
THE U.S. GOVERNMENT RESTRICTED

00:02:25.626 --> 00:02:29.931
