00:02:27.128 --> 00:02:30.765
BRITAIN'S PARLIAMENT WENT IN THE

00:02:30.064 --> 00:02:31.499
OPPOSITE DIRECTION.

00:02:30.898 --> 00:02:35.136
IT PASSED LEGISLATION KNOWN AS

00:02:31.632 --> 00:02:35.870
THE SNOOPERS CHARTER IN 2016

00:02:35.269 --> 00:02:39.173
THAT REQUIRES INTERNET SERVICE

00:02:36.003 --> 00:02:40.875
PROVIDERS TO KEEP BROWSING DATA

00:02:39.307 --> 00:02:42.877
FOR A YEAR DOWN LIKE A YEAR.

